extends layout

block content
  main.container
    section.page-head
      p.kicker About us
      h1 A downtown donut tradition
      p.lede Since 1992, the shop has paired small-batch dough with a bright, modern café for neighbors and newcomers.
    section.split
      div
        h3 Our story
        p We started as a family counter-service spot and kept the same focus: warm hospitality, local ingredients, and donuts made by hand before sunrise.
        p The café stays minimal and cozy so every visit feels calm, whether you are grabbing a dozen or sipping a latte with friends.
      div.info-card.tan
        h3 Quick facts
        ul.bullets
          li 30+ years in the downtown community
          li Fresh donuts every hour until sellout
          li Single-origin coffee roasted weekly
          li Delivery available through popular apps
    section.callout
      h3 Visit the café
      p 245 Main Street • Open daily • Friendly faces all morning
      a.button.secondary(href='/menu') Browse the menu
